<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Delta Jan-March net up 22.04 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Delta Jan-March net up 22.04 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Delta Electronics Inc said on Tuesday its net profit in the first three months of 1997 rose 22.04 percent to T$500.07 million from the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Delta's January-March sales were T$3.0229 billion, up 6.95 percent from 1996's T$2.826 billion.</p>
<p>It did not give a reason for the rises.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
